\f0\b\fs26 \cf2 POV & TONE\
\f1\b0\fs22 \
\f1\b0\fs22 \cf2 Recommend close-third on Sarah. Her interiority carries the scene\'92s one real emotional beat (the flicker, the crowd she can\'92t vanish into), and Chanta \'97 the other plausible platform POV \'97 is absent by design. Precedent: \'93Vegas show,\'94 \'93Sarah and Eloise talk,\'94 and the Inauguration throne scene all run through Sarah. Register: camp-excess comedy (thrones, regalia, a floating cigar-pig) carrying a contained, almost wordless emotional charge underneath \'97 same mix as the Inauguration scene\'92s banter-over-bombast. Do not let the emotional beat get talky; both Sarah and Eloise are canonically minimalist under pressure, so underplay rather than explain.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa51\partightenfactor0\cf2 \
